-- title:
--   Emit trials and the seal for one feasible boundary assignment
-- statement:
--   On the successful branch, the separator assignment has passed all table checks and its word indices are already present at the boundary vertices. Generate the trial tape for each component vertex and each permitted word, in order, then the seal with the canonical key. The source execution must preserve the enclosing loop state and satisfy the uniform cost bound.
-- source:
--   Ravichandran and Reyzin, Exact Sum-of-Radii Clustering under Any Constant Stability, Appendix A.4 and A.6. Implementation lemma for the boundary assignment loop.

